{"product":{"id":8059802189902,"title":"Summer Freshies Discovery Set","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis set brings together three refreshing summer signatures — an icy fruity aquatic, a sparkling citrus-tea fragrance, and a bright grapefruit-marine scent. Three miniatures designed for warm-weather wear, capturing three different takes on effortless freshness.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInside:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHawas Ice\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is frozen apple, bergamot, lemon, and star anise over orange blossom, iced marine accords, plum, and cardamom, settling into crystal moss, driftwood, amber, and musk — icy, vibrant, and refreshing.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMarwa\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is bergamot, lemon, and orange over ginger, cinnamon, and neroli, settling into ambroxan, black tea, olibanum, and guaiac wood — fresh, spicy, and refined.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMykonos Reflection\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is grapefruit, ginger, and bergamot over marine notes, cardamom, and lily of the valley, settling into musk, patchouli, amber, and ambroxan — crisp, airy, and sophisticated.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThree summer freshies, one exceptional set — the perfect way to discover your next warm-weather signature.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Scentira","product_type":"Bundle","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:49:26+05:30","handle":"summer-freshies-samp